    "Definition 23", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "008f8bc5-60a8-451e-9a1d-b0c9e6481892"], Cell["\<\
Parallel lines are those in a plane which do not meet, however far produced.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"1d508a2e-4bc4-46c5-8b16-aa2bca10a9e2"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "6590104b-054a-4043-9ea2-6be968f42316"], Cell[
